id: pm-jira-shared-transaction-wait
title: Investigate live SDK transaction lock exhaustion in concurrent Jira imports
description: "The unchanged separate-process persistence test fails in both a complete quick npm suite and a focused retry: a live sdk-workspace-transaction lock owned by pm-jira remains held beyond the roughly 3-second SDK wait. Atomic Jira import reports rollback is not confirmed. This is outside the reusable caller pin and needs an isolated native transaction and recovery investigation; do not weaken lock or rollback assertions."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
